CI: stop process_build_logs backtracking

process_build_logs.py times out the kolla-build-rocky-10 post playbook:
its unanchored ".+" fields backtrack catastrophically over a 128kB
JSON-escaped pip warning in bifrost-base.log. Restrict every captured
field to "\S+", which cannot cross whitespace, and the separator after
"Package" to "\s+", so there is only one way to match each field.

